{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Kuouo5CedI1793336396.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>勞工及福利局局長孫玉菡見記者，回應宏福苑火災事宜。孫玉菡向市民再次道歉，表示行政長官李家超要求相關局長推動改革，吸取教訓，更好發揮領導作用。自己作為政治任命官員，要支持行政長官施政，向行政長官負責。地盤全面禁煙等措施都會落實，法例生效至今已發出87張定額罰款通知書。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:43:56.049627+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T04:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.898451+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:39:13.286291+00:00","content_hash":"e5cced60a8bac2ee76c203d7c54543161b07478fb8ea5fb17c5dbe2a3baf707d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:43:56.049627+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}